Hi,

Running about at SSB but off the top of my head:

tipcex will reduce the size of either the boxes or the species names, statecex does the size of the boxes at nodes and maybe tips also -- so try those.

show.tip.label controls whether or not the species names are plotted.

In general, plot_BioGeoBEARS_results() just wraps standard APE functions -- plot.phylo(), nodelabels(), etc., so for further customization just look at that code and modify as you like.

Cheers!
Nick

