Thanks Nick- I looked at the code and here is the answer: Under plot_BioGeoBEARS_results, for the pie plots (plotwhat = "pie"), statecex controls the pie size, but pie_tip_state_cex controls the box size out at the tip. So if you add   pie_tip_state_cex = 0 to your plot_BioGeoBEARS_results() command it will delete the boxes. pie_tip_state_cex = 0.1 makes them very small, etc.
#DudeJustLookAtTheCode

